※ pl4g-test: compile=error
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4623 LANG_CONTAINER_CANNOT_COPY

※ An element not provably made in its container's allocator is copied into it, and a record
※ holding text cannot be copied yet: what its fields point into would want a walk of its own.

type R = f: str

@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    let a: mut arena = ⎕arena
    defer ⎕empty(a)
    let l: [R] = [R(.f ← "x")] in a
    if #l = 1: 0u6 else: 1u6
